1
00:00:00,247 --> 00:00:03,667
...all the weekends of a given month
plus three weeknights."

2
00:00:06,545 --> 00:00:08,545
- That's absurd.
- No.

3
00:00:08,713 --> 00:00:11,923
You initialed it. See? "L.H., L.H., L.H."

4
00:00:12,092 --> 00:00:15,802
Okay, wait. I only initialed it
because I never thought it would happen.

5
00:00:17,097 --> 00:00:22,097
(Leonard:)I initialed another clause naming you
my sidekick in case I get superpowers.

6
00:00:22,811 --> 00:00:24,771
Hm. Yes, you did.

7
00:00:26,064 --> 00:00:28,854
(Sheldon:)Now to review, the following provisions
are hereby activated.

8
00:00:29,025 --> 00:00:32,865
In the refrigerator, as opposed to two
separate shelves and one communal shelf...

9
00:00:33,029 --> 00:00:36,659
(Sheldon:)...the three of us now get individual shelves
and the door becomes communal.

10
00:00:36,825 --> 00:00:40,455
(Sheldon:)Next, apartment vacuuming shall be
increased from two to three times a week...

11
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,580
(Sheldon:)...to accommodate the increased
accumulation of dead skin cells.

12
00:00:43,748 --> 00:00:46,088
(Sheldon:)The bathroom schedule.
I'm given to understand...

13
00:00:46,251 --> 00:00:50,041
(Sheldon:)...women have different needs,
so we'll have to discuss that.

14
00:00:52,591 --> 00:00:55,131
(Steph:)- I'm going to bed.
- But, yeah, but...

15
00:00:55,302 --> 00:00:56,592
(Sheldon:)At least take this with you.

16
00:00:56,761 --> 00:01:00,891
(Sheldon:)Look, and have Stephanie
initial here, here, here, here...

17
00:01:01,266 --> 00:01:04,146
(Sheldon:)...and here.

18
00:01:04,311 --> 00:01:05,981
(Sheldon:)This states that she does not now...

19
00:01:06,146 --> 00:01:09,316
(Sheldon:)...nor does she intend to play a percussive
or brass instrument.

20
00:01:13,028 --> 00:01:14,488
[SIGHS]

21
00:01:18,783 --> 00:01:20,493
[HUMMING]

22
00:01:24,956 --> 00:01:26,956
[IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE]
Sure sounds like a tumor...

23
00:01:27,125 --> 00:01:30,025
(Sheldon:)...pressing on the auditory nerve.

